dirk — a terminal multiplexer that knows what its sessions are for.

The following people have contributed to dirk. Names are added here on a
contributor's first accepted change; see `git log` for the full record.

Oddur Sigurdsson  <oddurs@gmail.com>   original author and maintainer

dirk carries work from two of the author's earlier projects, both under the
same terms: the Gotham palette and the sidebar and rail designs come from
smali, and the naming policy in src/name.rs is a port of namesync.

